key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-08T19:14:15-07:00","id":508631,"title":"","content":"I would buy any of the city/country sourcebooks that have yet to be translated into English.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5525-rebelwithoutaclan","name":"RebelWithoutAClan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5525_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T14:43:09-08:00","id":1033661,"title":"","content":"Bumping this, because with the rise of the new White Wolf, something like this becomes a much more likely possibility.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Find my products on the ST Vault here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/225678/Dark-New-England-Five-Chronicle-Jumpstarts-Bundle?affiliate_id=235787\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/pro...iate_id=235787</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12515-inclusivegaming","name":"InclusiveGaming","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T14:49:05-08:00","id":1033662,"title":"","content":"hm, maybe. But since i already believe to ahve the english version i doubt id buy ig again to have it in german. but my players dont speak englsih well they may want to get it in german","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4364-orkar","name":"Orkar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4364_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-18T18:10:22-08:00","id":1034366,"title":"","content":"Yes. 100% yes.<br /> <br /> Edit: As I'm currently running a Tremere-oriented chronicle, hell, I'd probably even buy a German version, if it was a proper PDF rather than a scan, so I could Google-translate it.<br /> <br /> Edit again: wait, can you copy-paste with that version?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":231,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/231-blitzburger","user":"Blitzburger","date":". 01-18-2017, 09:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/231-blitzburger","name":"Blitzburger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar231_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T01:14:27-08:00","id":1034484,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/503424-would-you-buy-a-translated-vienna-by-night?p=506125#post506125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Please allow me to clarify.<br /> <br /> I have zero interest in publishing my own translation.<br /> <br /> I want to give my money to CCP and Feder &amp; Schwert for the translated book.<br /> <br /> I am asking if others would do the same.<br /> <br /> This Post's intent is to generate interest in what would be a profitable and fun business venture for all involved.<br /> <br /> Would you be interested in this theoretical purchase, Donovan Rivers?</div> </div> </div> </div>I would not be interested in a translated &quot;Vienna by night&quot;. First of all, I already own the German version (I'm German myself), so I wouldn't need a translation. Second, I found this sourcebook not that helpful for our chronicle, so even if the translation was updated (the original German version is 20 years old) I couldn't use most of the material in our stories. And third, we play mostly off-canon, so most of the material in the sourcebooks contradicts the events and characters in our chronicle.<br /> To make a long story short: I would pass on &quot;Vienna by night&quot;.<br /> <br /> Oh, and by the way: I don't think Feder &amp; Schwert has any say in this matter anymore, as the German edition of V20 is now published by Ulisses Spiele. And they have no intent (or no rights) whatsoever to publish old material (they didn't even publish a single new V20 sourcebook after those that came along with the initial crowdfunding...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Growing old is mandatory<br /> Growing up is optional</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2578-donovan-rivers","name":"Donovan Rivers","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T07:13:46-08:00","id":1034576,"title":"","content":"Yup. I would.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-hunters-hunted-ii\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img692/7017/hh2support.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-anarchs-unbound\" target=\"_blank\"> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img703/6636/6kvo.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-mage-the-ascension-20th-anniversary-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-w20-book-of-the-wyrm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/507-ignytezero","name":"IgnyteZero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T09:05:37-08:00","id":1034644,"title":"","content":"I would buy it too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12080-rasetra","name":"Rasetra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-06T03:27:51-08:00","id":1058859,"title":"","content":"If it were available, I'd absolutely splash out on it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.obsidianportal.com/campaigns/the-concord-of-ashes\" target=\"_blank\">The Concord of Ashes</a>, my Dark Ages Vampire Chronicle","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1790-haligaunt","name":"Haligaunt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1790_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-06T12:00:13-08:00","id":1059103,"title":"","content":"Absolutely. I'm especially interested in it due to the geographical (to Budapest, Vienna is literally the closest neighbor) and historical reasons between Austria and Hungary, so it would be a great source to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If nothing worked, then let's think!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6363-pm\u00e1rk","name":"PM\u00e1rk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6363_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2363"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-06T12:06:06-08:00","id":1059105,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PM\u00e1rk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/503424-would-you-buy-a-translated-vienna-by-night?p=1059103#post1059103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Absolutely. I'm especially interested in it due to the geographical (to Budapest, Vienna is literally the closest neighbor) and historical reasons between Austria and Hungary, so it would be a great source to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>As an aside, i think there's some Dark Ages material related to Budapest in Transylvania by Night. You might already know, but i thought it was relevant to bring up in relation to your post.<br /> <br /> PS: In fact the book has a box listing the NPCs per domain/region at the start of the chapter 4, what should be of considerable use. Some of those NPCs will also make appearances with varying degrees of relevance across the Transylvania Chronicles books. Houses of Tremere might make good reference material too, as it has info on Ceoris, that being located somewhere in Transylvania should also be relatively close too, i guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 03-07-2017, 08:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T13:57:51-08:00","id":1059726,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volesus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/503424-would-you-buy-a-translated-vienna-by-night?p=503575#post503575\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <d